{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"zainabs-big-feelings","version":1,"title":"Zainab’s Big Feelings","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Zainab was five and a half. Today she was going to her cousin’s birthday party. She felt happy and excited!","sentences":["Zainab was five and a half.","Today she was going to her cousin’s birthday party.","She felt happy and excited!"],"image":"sha256:724c90e1dc524b69acd63f7de5159c3aec7ee8332ad14ba8e5a7818ba861d5fd","alt":"A girl in a pink dress skips towards a decorated party yard.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:c57ee8cc8f79de5d6d6f67fa0d49546b6b7d56c0145f285f42fc350b8b70f79d","durationMs":9760,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2850],[2850,7342],[7342,9760]],"words":[[0,518],[518,777],[777,1122],[1122,1381],[1381,1554],[1554,2850],[2850,3282],[3282,3541],[3541,3800],[3800,4232],[4232,4405],[4405,4664],[4664,5269],[5269,5960],[5960,7342],[7342,7601],[7601,7946],[7946,8378],[8378,8637],[8637,9760]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"At the party, Zainab was given a bright red balloon. She tied it to her wrist. It bobbed above her head.","sentences":["At the party, Zainab was given a bright red balloon.","She tied it to her wrist.","It bobbed above her head."],"image":"sha256:9940c795fee8b43acbaa485b80a2fbd2e5c369b4263e635d35cf0712c291f6ca","alt":"The girl proudly holds up her wrist with a red balloon bobbing above her.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:0580b7a3169f4335ead72c5ecbf32ce29d746f731e7a888ac50a0b3269dfd8ef","durationMs":9120,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4640],[4640,7040],[7040,9120]],"words":[[0,160],[160,400],[400,1200],[1200,1680],[1680,1920],[1920,2320],[2320,2480],[2480,2960],[2960,3200],[3200,4640],[4640,4880],[4880,5200],[5200,5360],[5360,5520],[5520,5760],[5760,7040],[7040,7200],[7200,7680],[7680,8080],[8080,8320],[8320,9120]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Pop! The balloon burst on a thorn bush. Zainab’s tummy dropped. Her eyes filled with tears.","sentences":["Pop!","The balloon burst on a thorn bush.","Zainab’s tummy dropped.","Her eyes filled with tears."],"image":"sha256:d54fdc3346b53a5dcd736bdba6a29cbffeb3510d9bb59b2c660824fd3b6b1ee1","alt":"The girl stands beside a thorny bush with a torn balloon and teary eyes.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:4b86bd34c4116bbd9eec7515f69ccecc4a9b887c558251ab12a50c7836f91530","durationMs":8320,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,1049],[1049,3973],[3973,6222],[6222,8320]],"words":[[0,1049],[1049,1274],[1274,1799],[1799,2174],[2174,2324],[2324,2474],[2474,2849],[2849,3973],[3973,4498],[4498,4873],[4873,6222],[6222,6447],[6447,6747],[6747,7197],[7197,7497],[7497,8320]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"‘I hate this party!’ shouted Zainab, stamping her foot. Her face felt hot and her hands felt tight.","sentences":["‘I hate this party!’ shouted Zainab, stamping her foot.","Her face felt hot and her hands felt tight."],"image":"sha256:b27e0879529cdd40d1ca0076128f26c6dd92e11e6b856bc66cc6f9ba4f21985d","alt":"The girl stamps her foot with clenched fists and a cross face.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:9fb735c77062ade91dd0a78f4b8d57852a711866003ee0108a775be14b74548f","durationMs":9520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6058],[6058,9520]],"words":[[0,173],[173,519],[519,865],[865,2250],[2250,2856],[2856,3808],[3808,4500],[4500,4760],[4760,6058],[6058,6318],[6318,6664],[6664,7010],[7010,7270],[7270,7530],[7530,7790],[7790,8223],[8223,8569],[8569,9520]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Her cousin Bashiru came over. ‘Are you sad or cross?’ he asked. Zainab thought. ‘Both,’ she said. ‘Sad about my balloon. Cross at the thorn bush.’","sentences":["Her cousin Bashiru came over.","‘Are you sad or cross?’ he asked.","Zainab thought.","‘Both,’ she said.","‘Sad about my balloon.","Cross at the thorn bush.’"],"image":"sha256:e2778e828f75fadb44d747dab3ecb20314355f28e4a5a721e98be8d6004e3576","alt":"