et’s play football!’ said Bashiru."],"image":"sha256:49931a1426f9141bcceab428cdaa13bdd1ed2df6c4f3cc09bbb65775c67f1e05","alt":"The girl opens her eyes, calmer, as the boy holds out his football with a smile.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:f8c6827eefa36e462d044ad7576d6fae93fca59ed2787bcb9436afbdafaf83f6","durationMs":12200,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2343],[2343,6544],[6544,12200]],"words":[[0,242],[242,646],[646,969],[969,2343],[2343,2505],[2505,2909],[2909,3232],[3232,3394],[3394,3879],[3879,4525],[4525,4767],[4767,5090],[5090,6544],[6544,6786],[6786,6948],[6948,7271],[7271,8645],[8645,8968],[8968,9291],[9291,10826],[10826,11149],[11149,12200]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Zainab played, laughed and danced. She still missed her balloon a little, and that was okay. The end.","sentences":["Zainab played, laughed and danced.","She still missed her balloon a little, and that was okay.","The end."],"image":"sha256:c1c2e3a379147e3f7f47030d3d1f570eab5ba284b95f9052e85cd33675d28b8f","alt":"The girl kicks a football happily among other children at the party.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:ef1cb463001ddc681f4c07b7e5a245767718d15a1607ccf8b31da08c07166e44","durationMs":9880,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3683],[3683,8873],[8873,9880]],"words":[[0,502],[502,1423],[1423,2009],[2009,2260],[2260,3683],[3683,3934],[3934,4353],[4353,4855],[4855,5106],[5106,5692],[5692,5859],[5859,6780],[6780,7031],[7031,7366],[7366,7617],[7617,8873],[8873,9124],[9124,9880]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"feel-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":3,"question":"What happened to Zainab’s balloon?","options":["It burst on a thorn bush","It flew away","She gave it to a friend"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"feel-voc","type":"vocabulary","afterPage":4,"word":"cross","definition":"Feeling angry or upset.","distractors":["Feeling sleepy","Feeling very hungry"]},{"id":"feel-p1","type":"prediction","afterPage":4,"prompt":"Zainab feels 